# Source imagery for the POS inventory ingest (references/090426/pos-item-imagery).
#
# 134MB of full-resolution PNGs — 120MB of it is the ball galleries, which carry
# nine 1200px shots per SKU where the ingest takes only the first. The *derived*
# 500px webp under store/images/ are committed and are what the app serves, so
# nothing here is needed to build or run the project.
#
# What IS committed: catalog.json (the authored titles, prices and descriptions),
# the ball manifest.csv, and each folder's source.txt with its original URLs — so
# the ingest can be re-run against a re-downloaded source set.
references/090426/pos-item-imagery/*.png
references/090426/pos-item-imagery/PGA TOUR Superstore Ball Imagery/*/*.png
